    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Kalabrynne Iomedar commissioned the first of these shields, which have become some of the Shining Sentinels' most valued equipment, replicated among these knights. A "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "shining shield",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is a seemingly simple wooden shield with the Shining Oath engraved on the inside."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "While raised, a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "shining shield",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " moves itself to provide cover for your allies. If you have this shield raised and would provide cover to an ally against a foe by standing between them, the cover you provide increases one step. Thus, if you were to grant lesser cover, you grant standard cover instead; if you were to grant standard cover, you instead grant greater cover."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
